# 仓库内一律 LF：源文件、README 与配置都以 LF 写入索引，
# 避免 Windows 检出的 CRLF 让 blob hash 随平台变化。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
